title: 종강총회_신아산_영문
---
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: I really want to ride the carousel...
ASan: But I guess it wouldn't be much fun riding it alone...
{name()}: ASan!
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_shock>>
ASan: Oh, {name()}?
ASan: Wait, did you actually collect all the tickets?
{name()}: Yep.
{name()}: Because I wanted to ride it with you.
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
<<show san_blush>>
ASan: !!!!!!!!!!
<<like 신아산>>
<<change lvSan +10>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Well, it's not like I had anyone else to ride with, so I guess you'll do.
ASan: Hmph.
{name()}: Your face says otherwise, though.
ASan: NO, IT DOESN'T!!!!!!
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Anyway, let's hurry up and get in line.
(We chatted as we waited for our turn.)
(As soon as it was our time to enter, ASan grabbed my hand and started sprinting.)
{name()}: Whoa, where are we going?
ASan: No time to explain! Just get on, NOW!!!!!!!!
(After being dragged along, I found myself forced into...)
(A 'carriage' being pulled by a majestic-looking horse.)
{name()}: A carriage?
ASan: Yep! And I'll be the one driving it!
ASan: Just sit back and witness my elite driving skills, okay?
(ASan looked at me with an innocent grin and flashed a peace sign.)
*Toot-toot!*
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Ahahaha!!!!!!!!!!!!!
ASan: Run, my noble steed!!!!!!!!!
(The carousel began to rotate slowly.)
(Even though the horse was only moving up and down, ASan moved as if she were)
(actually steering and controlling the ride.)
(Soon, she turned her head to look at me.)
ASan: How is the ride quality, passenger?
{name()}: It's the best!
ASan: Excellent! Then I shall increase our speed immediately~!!
<<wait 2>>
*Tooooooot!*
(The horn blew, signaling the end of the ride.)
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Ah, that was seriously so much fun.
ASan: I kept looking back to check on my passenger, though...
ASan: I thought my neck was gonna snap, haha!
{name()}: Haha, thanks to you, I had a safe trip~
{name()}: To be honest, I was worried if a carousel would actually be fun.
{name()}: But I had a blast because of you.
ASan: .....Me too.
ASan: It's my favorite ride, but this is the first time I've ever ridden it with someone else.
ASan: I was worried I went a bit overboard because I was so excited...
ASan: But thank you so much for enjoying it with me!
ASan: Shall we take a photo before we get off?
ASan: Do a peace sign! Peace~
<<cheese 종강총회_신아산2_영문>>
===

title: 종강총회_신아산2_영문
---
<<hide>>
<<bg 신아산_종강총회>>
ASan: You'll ride with me again next time, right?
{name()}: Of course. Next time, I'll be the one driving.
ASan: Pfft, I'm counting on you then!
<<wait 3>>
<<end>>
===